      "findings": [
        "Original Portable Ops Null short pale hair, black lower-face cloth, natural human body, anatomical RIGHT red shoulder/LEFT dark insignia retained; no later Gray Fox cyborg incarnation merger.",
        "Sixteen complete figures independently authored each face; forward machete slash RIGHT6/LEFT6 and reverse blade/handling poses physically distinct.",
        "Original authored shortened formal coat, opaque white shirt/bow/vest, original-armoured shoulder/bracers/gear; two natural arms/legs and full shoes on standing/KO poses.",
        "Both real idle-match captures show the new body on the proper side with coherent floor and comparable human stature."
      ],
      "limits": [
        "Tuxedo and compact shoulder adaptation are authored, not released canonical clothing; new explicit cloth lapels/buttons are intended costume changes.",
